WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.480
[This tape was transferred from a 16mm film
original by Colorlab for the National Library

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.480
of Medicine, June 2006, NLM call number HF
1680 parts 1, 2, and 3.]

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.480
[Restricted film to be shown to authorized
personnel only.]

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.480
[United States Navy training film.]

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.480
[Produced under the supervision of the Bureau
of Aeronautics for the Bureau of Medicine

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.480
and Surgery by Audio Productions, Inc.]

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.480
[Personal hygiene for women, Part 1.]

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.480
Raise your right hands and repeat after me.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:01:02.110
I, I, do solemnly swear, do solemnly swear,
that I will bear true faith and allegiance,

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:05.019
that I will bear true faith and allegiance.

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:07.610
That all statements made by me, that all statements
made by me, that is now given in this record,

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:12.180
that is now given in this record, are correct,
are correct.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:16.680
You are now in the Navy.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:20.080
To this post of duty you have come from every
walk of life.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:29.470
You have left important jobs, and you have
given up other opportunities.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:34.229
In your previous experience you represent
the best examples of American womanhood.

00:01:34.229 --> 00:01:42.560
Physically fit, resourceful, alert, intelligent
and morally dependable.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.280
You are the American woman.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:51.590
Because you want to live in the forefront
of your times, in ideals and in sacrifice,

00:01:51.590 --> 00:02:21.720
you have elected this as your chance to serve.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:26.710
And you've chosen a woman-sized job.

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:31.680
The purpose of your basic training is not
to lessen your individuality, nor to change

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:36.239
the particular character of your talents.

00:02:36.239 --> 00:02:41.000
It is, rather, to provide you with self confidence
and habits of living that will raise your

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.930
talents to the highest peak of efficiency.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:54.329
You, the modern woman, are well equipped to
set a high standard of voluntary performance.

00:02:54.329 --> 00:02:59.080
You have a background of resourcefulness and
stamina derived from the democratic culture

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.629
of your age.

00:03:02.629 --> 00:03:08.230
You have the skills which can be adapted to
your new responsibilities.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:11.829
Now you will need to raise your standards
of physical health to perfection.

00:03:11.829 --> 00:03:20.409
And to keep yourself in the best possible
condition to perform any duty you may be given.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:25.459
You will need to keep an eye open for any
sign that your efficiency is low, and to seek

00:03:25.459 --> 00:03:39.239
medical advice whenever you suspect that you
might not be quite all on the job.

00:03:39.239 --> 00:03:43.829
I find nothing wrong physically, but I do
think you're suffering from fatigue.

00:03:43.829 --> 00:03:45.010
Been working hard?

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:48.989
Well yes sir, you see I wanted ... I know,
we all have a big job to do.

00:03:48.989 --> 00:03:53.379
But you worked hard during your basic training
too, didn't you?

00:03:53.379 --> 00:04:00.879
You may have felt tired but you weren't rundown,
that's because you followed the regular routine.

00:04:00.879 --> 00:04:05.689
You had a good diet which included plenty
of energy-giving foods, and lots of fresh

00:04:05.689 --> 00:04:10.110
vegetables and milk to supply all the proteins
and vitamins you need.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:13.700
You got regular hours of sleep, and plenty
of exercise, didn't you?

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.709
I had to - regulations, you know.

00:04:16.709 --> 00:04:20.540
Yes, but the purpose of those regulations
was to set up habits that would keep you in

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.470
top notch physical condition all the time.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:27.530
If you break those habits, you're going to
fall down on the job.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:33.030
Now I'm going to give you a prescription.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:39.870
And this is the prescription the medical officer
gave her: [EFFICIENCY] a balanced diet, a

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:45.389
normal regular amount of sleep, daily exercise
and relaxation.

00:04:45.389 --> 00:04:51.730
These are all regular needs which can never
be made up if they are lost.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:59.030
To maintain top notch working efficiency,
the right balance must be kept.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:05.740
Neglecting any one of these props to efficiency
is a sure way to physical and mental fatigue.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:11.270
Fatigue and faulty posture go hand and hand.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.230
Let's see why.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:21.670
Here in simple diagram is the body skeleton
and some of the muscles which hold it erect.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:29.540
Correct posture is correct because it is natural,
easy, and involves no strain on the muscles.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:38.710
A plum line dropped from the ear should pass
through the shoulder, hip, knee, and ankle

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:43.820
joints.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:48.600
In incorrect posture, the muscles are under
strain and have to work much harder to hold

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:52.100
the body erect.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:59.890
A line through the same joints is no longer
straight.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:06.530
Your internal organs are fitted into close
but adequate space.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:11.300
Incorrect posture forces them into unnatural
positions so that it is hard for them to do

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.400
their work.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:19.550
You will feel better, and look better too,
if you watch your posture.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:29.430
Check it often and remember to stand tall,
walk tall, be conscious of it, it will be

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:33.470
natural in a short time.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:42.750
Sit tall, you'll feel and work better.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:46.750
You are proud of the fact that you are healthier
and stronger than the women of twenty five

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:52.160
years ago, and your clothes are styled for
action.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:57.520
Your uniform is more practical than the ones
the Yeomanettes had in the last war.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:05.170
You can be glad of that, and you can be glad
that you don't have to wear this armor plate.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:11.690
Pouring the body into this unnatural shape
congests the internal organs and makes it

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:16.670
difficult to even to stand naturally.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:22.180
We know today that girdles and corsets are
supposed to support and protect the figure.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.390
Many women don't really need them.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:30.580
But if you do wear a girdle it must be right
for you.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:35.030
You should not tolerate a girdle that fits
improperly any more than you would wear old

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:38.330
fashioned clothing.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:43.080
Too much tightness or downward pressure of
weight constricts the abdominal organs and

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:47.800
interferes with their normal activity.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:55.240
If a brassiere is required it should not compress
the breasts or push them downward.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:08:00.380
For those who really need them, well fitting
girdles and brassieres will support the figure

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.380
and relieve fatigue.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:12.080
The correctly fitted girdle lifts the abdomen
and helps to flatten the back.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:19.040
Another special reason for fatigue is a poorly
fitted shoe.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:25.550
Nature has provided you with cleverly constructed
flexible arches formed by the bones and joints

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:30.370
which constitute the framework of the human
foot.

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:35.550
Every time the foot is brought down, this
framework absorbs the shock of contact with

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:40.750
the ground and supports your weight.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:46.649
But an incorrectly fitted shoe will nullify
all nature's good intentions.

00:08:46.649 --> 00:08:53.240
A shoe which is too small compresses the foot
and prevents natural action.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:58.260
It will in time deform the foot.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:02.260
If shoes are fitted properly, the inside edge
will be straight.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:06.950
There will be about half the breadth of the
thumb between the tip of the great toe and

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:10.130
the end of the shoe, and plenty of width.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:17.399
The shoe should not be so wide that the arches
spread or that rubbing causes blisters.

00:09:17.399 --> 00:09:23.050
The ball of the foot should rest upon the
seat which is the widest part of the shoe.

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:31.189
The leather of which your shoe is made should
be soft and pliable, yet the shoe itself should

00:09:31.189 --> 00:09:37.680
be reasonably heavy and should have a welt
sole to give the foot protection.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:47.620
A shoe with a lining and a strong shank is
the most comfortable for drill.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:52.319
Selecting a shoe which is not functional is
hardly less than bad taste.

00:09:52.319 --> 00:09:57.699
But you can rely on the smartness of an oxford
like this for ordinary wear.

00:09:57.699 --> 00:10:04.199
It supports the foot, and has heels which
are appropriate to any activity except long

00:10:04.199 --> 00:10:10.300
marches, hiking, or extensive field duty.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:19.749
For these purposes you need a shoe which has
a lower heel with a broader base.

00:10:19.749 --> 00:10:26.160
Badly fitting stockings can cause almost as
much discomfort as badly fitting shoes.

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:31.680
They ought to be about a half inch longer
than the foot to prevent binding.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:38.579
And a badly mended stocking like this will
soon produce a blister.

00:10:38.579 --> 00:10:43.029
Stockings should be mended carefully with
a soft mending thread so that they will not

00:10:43.029 --> 00:10:45.360
cause blisters.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:51.279
This expert method of weaving and interweaving
will give you a flat even surface which will

00:10:51.279 --> 00:10:55.870
not irritate the skin.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:11:00.839
Since your feet support your body all day
long they deserve special attention.

00:11:00.839 --> 00:11:07.399
Here is a simple exercise to strengthen them
if they are weak.

00:11:07.399 --> 00:11:13.649
Flex the toes as if you are picking up a marble,
then in the same motion turn the toes upward

00:11:13.649 --> 00:11:16.389
as if to show the marble to someone.

00:11:16.389 --> 00:11:25.209
This is an easy exercise which should be repeated
often.

00:11:25.209 --> 00:11:30.600
If your feet are tender and tired from unaccustomed
marching, toughen them up by soaking them

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:36.189
in cold water to which salt has been added.

00:11:36.189 --> 00:11:39.339
Be careful to dry thoroughly between the toes.

00:11:39.339 --> 00:11:47.620
Powder is helpful, and it should be used in
the morning as well as after bathing.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:55.749
You are less likely to get athlete's foot
if the skin is dry.

00:11:55.749 --> 00:11:59.690
Athlete's foot is an annoying and uncomfortable
disease.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.970
It appears first as patches of white skin
between the toes.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:09.950
In advanced stages the skin itches and becomes
painful.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:18.300
If you get it, report for medical treatment
and be careful not to give it to others.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:24.370
Since the fungus which causes athlete's foot
lives in the moistness of showers, pools,

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:29.649
and bathrooms, it is always wise to walk through
the chemical solution which is provided in

00:12:29.649 --> 00:12:40.589
most places to kill the organisms, and to
wear slippers in these places.

00:12:40.589 --> 00:12:45.100
Corns and calluses are caused by badly fitting
shoes.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:50.779
To relieve the pain and discomfort caused
by them, soak the feet in soapy water until

00:12:50.779 --> 00:12:54.869
the skin is soft.

00:12:54.869 --> 00:12:58.629
Then file the corn with an emery board if
possible.

00:12:58.629 --> 00:13:05.660
Cutting or tearing them out is dangerous and
may result in infection.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:12.040
A moleskin adhesive dressing or a bit of lambs
wool or even wool yarn if the corn is between

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:16.720
the toes will help to relieve the pressure
and the pain.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:22.139
The only way to prevent corns and calluses
is to wear properly fitted shoes.

00:13:22.139 --> 00:13:30.490
Choice of shoes, girdles, all articles of
clothing is only part of the talent for good

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:35.540
grooming to which every Wave aspires.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:40.439
Here is where patience and resourcefulness
count, for good grooming is not guaranteed

00:13:40.439 --> 00:13:45.550
by the fact that you happen to possess a smartly
tailored uniform.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:52.209
It demands constant attention to little details,
sending your uniforms to the cleaners often,

00:13:52.209 --> 00:13:57.750
or sponging and pressing them regularly yourself.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:04.360
It means shining your shoes every day, keeping
your underclothes clean even if laundering

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.120
facilities are limited.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:16.339
And by no means least, good grooming calls
for strict attention to bodily cleanliness.

00:14:16.339 --> 00:14:21.350
During your daily bath you will need to wash
every part of your body thoroughly.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:26.790
The superstition which still crops up occasionally
in spite of modern education and cleanliness,

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:32.019
that intimate parts of the body should never
be touched, even in washing, is as ridiculous

00:14:32.019 --> 00:14:34.670
as it is old fashioned.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:40.429
Soap and water are needed all over the body.

00:14:40.429 --> 00:14:45.380
Ordinary soap and water cleanliness will also
get rid of normal body odors, though you may

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:52.070
want to use a mild underarm deodorant to neutralize
perspiration odors.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:58.519
Be careful to use only one which is non-irritating
to your skin.

00:14:58.519 --> 00:15:03.939
There are however artificial odors which arise
from disorders in the mouth or vagina and

00:15:03.939 --> 00:15:10.620
which, though unnoticeable to you, may be
very unpleasant to others.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:16.199
Don't hesitate to ask your friends if you
suspect such a condition.

00:15:16.199 --> 00:15:21.249
If they are really kind, they will tell you,
just as you should tell them, so that you

00:15:21.249 --> 00:15:25.329
can have the condition checked by your medical
officer.

00:15:25.329 --> 00:15:32.470
Simple medical treatment will often cure even
a deep seated condition of this sort.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:37.490
Then you will want to take good care of your
complexion.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:44.119
A healthy skin is acquired through the ordinary
routine of diet, sleep, and exercise, and

00:15:44.119 --> 00:15:49.949
is easily preserved by the use of plenty of
soap and water.

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:55.480
A little cold cream or mineral oil at night
is a good habit.

00:15:55.480 --> 00:16:02.869
Care in applying your cosmetics only to a
clean skin with a clean powder puff is another.

00:16:02.869 --> 00:16:07.639
These simple methods will keep your face as
fresh and attractive as the most elaborate

00:16:07.639 --> 00:16:11.589
beauty treatments.

00:16:11.589 --> 00:16:19.489
A stiff nail brush, soap and water, a cuticle
stick to clean around and under the nails,

00:16:19.489 --> 00:16:23.750
and plenty of vigorous scrubbing will keep
your hands soft.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:31.800
It will also keep the cuticle pliable so that
it can be pushed back with a towel.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:37.660
A little cold cream or mineral oil at night
now and then and regular attention to filing

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:42.850
your nails will keep your hands attractive
even if you should go for months without a

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:50.779
professional manicure.

00:16:50.779 --> 00:16:55.429
Daily vigorous brushing with a brush that
has long stiff bristles will add life and

00:16:55.429 --> 00:16:57.500
luster to your hair.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:04.270
And here are some hints about giving yourself
that shampoo you will need every week or two

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:12.250
depending upon the oiliness of your hair and
the conditions in which you live.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:19.309
If your hair and scalp are dry use a small
amount of oil the night before you wash it.

00:17:19.309 --> 00:17:27.260
Too much oil however will make the hair greasy
and will be difficult to remove.

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:30.929
Any excess should be rubbed off with a towel.

00:17:30.929 --> 00:17:39.030
There are several commercial preparations
on the market known as wetting agents which

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.360
are frequently more efficient than soap.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:46.730
If soap is used don't rub it directly on the
hair.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:50.130
Make it into a solution.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:55.740
Work the lather well into your hair, rubbing
the scalp with your fingertips and rinse it

00:17:55.740 --> 00:18:00.230
thoroughly until your hair squeaks when you
rub your hands over it.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:07.360
Wash your hair several times before the final
rinsing.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:11.820
Don't forget that you are responsible for
leaving the wash bowl and the shower drain

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:15.120
clean and ready for the next person who wants
to use it.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:21.980
A shower, if available, is the best method
for rinsing your hair.

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:32.100
At any rate, be sure you have removed all
the soap.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:36.950
Remove as much water as you can with a towel,
and while your hair is drying is a good time

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:40.350
to clean your comb and brush.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:46.019
A little ammonia added to plain water is a
good cleaning agent.

00:18:46.019 --> 00:18:49.000
Follow this with soap and water.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:57.149
Keep your comb and brush clean and allow no
one else to use them.

00:18:57.149 --> 00:19:02.460
If you are clever at such things, combing
the hair when it is partially dry and setting

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:09.610
it will produce much the same effect as the
hairdresser's finger waves.

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:18.940
Remember that clean hair will help protect
you against unsightly skin and scalp infections.

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:22.640
There are a number of different skin disorders
which produce rashes.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:31.539
Dandruff may be accompanied by an extensive
one; some come from an allergy; some may result

00:19:31.539 --> 00:19:35.940
partly from a poor diet and lack of exercise.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.860
The oily skin is characteristic of acne.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:47.049
Some, such as impetigo, may be contracted
by exchanging toilet articles, and some may

00:19:47.049 --> 00:19:49.060
be caused by syphilis.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:58.630
All of these skin disorders, no matter what
the cause, call for medical attention.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:03.300
It is possible that under difficult conditions
which arise in wartime, you may come into

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:07.880
contact with some form of lice.

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:15.789
Rather than being horrified, an intelligent
woman will seek medical advice in such a situation.

00:20:15.789 --> 00:20:21.370
If such advice is not available, you might
employ an old remedy to get rid of lice on

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.120
the head.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:36.600
Wet the hair thoroughly with equal parts of
kerosene and vinegar.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:43.320
Cover the hair with a towel for a half hour.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:52.190
Then wash with warm water and soap, or a wetting
agent.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:58.711
This process should be repeated after 8 days
[EIGHT DAYS LATER], and again after 8 more

00:20:58.711 --> 00:21:03.000
days have elapsed [AND AGAIN EIGHT DAYS LATER],
so that all lice hatching from remaining eggs

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:08.649
will be killed.

00:21:08.649 --> 00:21:13.070
There are other kinds of lice which are acquired
from close association with persons who are

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.380
infested.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.760
These are called body lice.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:23.870
Some are very dangerous because they may carry
typhus or other fevers.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:28.460
Crab lice may be caught from toilet seats
or from intimate contact with the body of

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:31.549
a person who has them.

00:21:31.549 --> 00:21:40.210
If you find them in the hair on any part of
the body, medical attention should be sought.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:45.799
Some of these instructions for good grooming
may be old stuff to you, but they bear repeating

00:21:45.799 --> 00:21:50.890
because they are essential to cleanliness
- and cleanliness is the basis of all good

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.200
looks.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:59.139
No woman who really cares about her appearance
or her health will neglect the matter of internal

00:21:59.139 --> 00:22:03.510
cleanliness which begins with the mouth.

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:08.700
We hardly need to be told to brush our teeth
at least twice a day, but a few hints about

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:13.340
proper methods maybe helpful.

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:18.460
Your toothbrush should have bristles of different
lengths which are set in tufts rather widely

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:19.460
spaced.

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:22.309
It should be kept clean and dry.

00:22:22.309 --> 00:22:30.200
In fact using two toothbrushes ultimately
is a good idea.

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:35.970
The best way to keep your teeth clean is to
brush them with an up and down motion.

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:40.860
This motion also massages the gums.

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:47.730
Additional massaging of your gums in this
manner will help to avoid pyorrhea.

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:50.659
Rinse thoroughly after brushing.

00:22:50.659 --> 00:22:57.130
Since it impossible to clean between your
teeth with a toothbrush, dental floss should

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:10.030
be used frequently.

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:15.500
The purpose of visiting the dentist at least
twice a year is to check and control decay,

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:27.590
prevent tartar from collecting, and make sure
the teeth and gums are healthy.

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:32.840
Constipation is a rather common condition,
but the cathartic habit or the enema habit,

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:39.669
in fact even the fear of constipation, frequently
has worse results than constipation itself.

00:23:39.669 --> 00:23:45.220
Let the medical officer advise laxatives if
they are really needed.

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:49.550
First you ought to have regular time for going
to the toilet.

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:51.730
In group living such as yours, it may be difficult.

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:56.120
But try to choose a time when you won't have
to hurry to make way for others, when you

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:57.860
can relax for a few minutes.

00:23:57.860 --> 00:24:00.279
By the way, do you drink much water?

00:24:00.279 --> 00:24:03.680
Not very much I'm afraid.

00:24:03.680 --> 00:24:06.529
Well drinking lots of water is important.

00:24:06.529 --> 00:24:11.480
And be sure you eat a balanced diet with plenty
of leafy vegetables and whole grain cereals.

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:18.159
Then, remember that the regularity with which
your bowels function depends on your general

00:24:18.159 --> 00:24:19.380
body tone.

00:24:19.380 --> 00:24:21.980
Sleep and exercise are important.

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:24.980
Do I have to have a bowel movement every day?

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:28.669
Not necessarily, though most people normally
do.

00:24:28.669 --> 00:24:33.820
The interval between movements may vary considerably
from person to person, but if the movements

00:24:33.820 --> 00:24:39.340
take place regularly and you feel well, it
doesn't matter.

00:24:39.340 --> 00:24:46.070
Constipation, if chronic, may cause a common
disorder known as piles or hemorrhoids.

00:24:46.070 --> 00:24:51.919
The intestines empty their contents into the
rectum which act as a reservoir.

00:24:51.919 --> 00:24:57.590
The rectum is well supplied with blood vessels.

00:24:57.590 --> 00:25:04.669
Here on a diagrammatic section through the
rectum we can see how hemorrhoids occur.

00:25:04.669 --> 00:25:10.269
Repeated straining and emptying the bowel
forces the blood vessels at the anus and sometimes

00:25:10.269 --> 00:25:16.620
part of the intestine itself down from their
normal place until they protrude.

00:25:16.620 --> 00:25:22.830
They are usually quite sore and often bleed.

00:25:22.830 --> 00:25:29.240
Preventing constipation helps to avoid them,
but if present, hemorrhoids should always

00:25:29.240 --> 00:25:37.210
receive prompt medical attention.

00:25:37.210 --> 00:25:41.789
As a part of your physical examination, the
medical officer checks the condition of the

00:25:41.789 --> 00:25:47.590
pelvic cavity where the organs of reproduction
are located.

00:25:47.590 --> 00:25:53.250
An intelligent woman will realize that this
is just as important as a regular dental examination

00:25:53.250 --> 00:25:57.419
or a check on her blood pressure.

00:25:57.419 --> 00:26:02.590
The reassurance that no structural difficulty
or acquired infection can interfere with the

00:26:02.590 --> 00:26:08.770
normal functioning of the body is conducive
to well being and she will welcome the opportunity

00:26:08.770 --> 00:26:16.190
which the Navy provides to have this examination
made by a competent medical officer.

00:26:16.190 --> 00:26:20.970
An intelligent woman will realize also that
it is not enough for the physician to know

00:26:20.970 --> 00:26:23.730
that her physical condition is good.

00:26:23.730 --> 00:26:30.370
She too must understand the structure and
function of all parts of her body.

00:26:30.370 --> 00:26:36.419
Unfortunately however, ignorance about the
reproductive system is still widespread.

00:26:36.419 --> 00:26:42.049
No human process has been the subject of more
superstition and fear and consequently the

00:26:42.049 --> 00:26:45.730
cause of more sorrow.

00:26:45.730 --> 00:26:56.000
Therefore you will want to know the truth
about every part of your own body.

00:26:56.000 --> 00:27:02.429
A woman's reproductive or sex organs are peculiarly
adaptive to the functions of childbearing.

00:27:02.429 --> 00:27:06.909
Here they are seen if they would appear if
the body were transparent.

00:27:06.909 --> 00:27:12.650
The main organs form a series of hollow or
tube like passages.

00:27:12.650 --> 00:27:18.590
The external parts of the reproductive organs
consist essentially of several folds of skin

00:27:18.590 --> 00:27:25.070
called the labia or lips and known as the
vulva.

00:27:25.070 --> 00:27:29.020
These folds of tissue cover important structures.

00:27:29.020 --> 00:27:32.889
One is the urethra from which urine is passed.

00:27:32.889 --> 00:27:40.179
Another is the clitoris a small body analogous
to the male penis.

00:27:40.179 --> 00:27:47.980
Here are the openings of two small glands
which provide a lubricating fluid called mucus.

00:27:47.980 --> 00:27:52.460
Covering more or less the entrance to the
internal organs is a membrane known as the

00:27:52.460 --> 00:27:55.179
hymen or maidenhead.

00:27:55.179 --> 00:28:02.220
Although the hymen is present in most instances,
some girls are born without it.

00:28:02.220 --> 00:28:05.259
It is often broken during childhood.

00:28:05.259 --> 00:28:10.879
The superstition that a woman is not a virgin
unless she has an unbroken hymen is completely

00:28:10.879 --> 00:28:18.559
inaccurate.

00:28:18.559 --> 00:28:25.029
For proper orientation let's look at the body
from a front view again.

00:28:25.029 --> 00:28:33.450
The reproductive organs can be seen in normal
position in the pelvic cavity.

00:28:33.450 --> 00:28:41.250
Let's split the model and turn it to observe
a section through the middle of these organs.

00:28:41.250 --> 00:28:45.919
Here we can pick up where we left off on the
external organs.

00:28:45.919 --> 00:28:51.110
The hymen as we have said stretches partly
over the entrance to the internal reproductive

00:28:51.110 --> 00:28:53.490
organs.

00:28:53.490 --> 00:28:59.230
The first of these is a channel like structure
called the vagina, which serves as a receptacle

00:28:59.230 --> 00:29:02.600
for the semen and forms a birth canal.

00:29:02.600 --> 00:29:14.350
It has a moist lining mucus membrane and its
walls lie in folds which can be easily distended.

00:29:14.350 --> 00:29:19.679
The cervix is located at the inner end of
the vagina forming the neck of the uterus

00:29:19.679 --> 00:29:22.490
or womb.

00:29:22.490 --> 00:29:27.230
The uterus is a pear shaped organ which is
normally about two and three quarter inches

00:29:27.230 --> 00:29:32.009
in length by one and three quarter inches
in width.

00:29:32.009 --> 00:29:37.460
Since its purpose is to shelter a baby during
pregnancy, the uterus is capable of enlarging

00:29:37.460 --> 00:29:41.009
to many times its original size.

00:29:41.009 --> 00:29:50.190
In addition to the organs of reproduction
we see in this view the bladder and the rectum.

00:29:50.190 --> 00:29:53.080
Here are the reproductive organs in front
view.

00:29:53.080 --> 00:30:01.340
At the upper end of the uterus are two tubes,
one on each side, called the ova ducts or

00:30:01.340 --> 00:30:03.830
fallopian tubes.

00:30:03.830 --> 00:30:11.389
Their purpose is to transport the ovum, or
egg, from the ovary into the uterus.

00:30:11.389 --> 00:30:18.649
There are two ovaries, each one located near
the end of a tube; and it is in the ovaries

00:30:18.649 --> 00:30:26.550
that the female reproductive cells, the ova,
are formed.

00:30:26.550 --> 00:30:33.380
When an egg is fully developed, it leaves
the ovary and enters one of the fallopian

00:30:33.380 --> 00:30:34.649
tubes.

00:30:34.649 --> 00:30:38.090
This process is called ovulation.

00:30:38.090 --> 00:30:44.419
The egg is then transported slowly toward
the uterus, so slowly that it travels only

00:30:44.419 --> 00:30:49.220
a few inches in three or four days.

00:30:49.220 --> 00:30:54.340
During that time it softens and begins to
be absorbed, unless it has been fertilized

00:30:54.340 --> 00:30:59.990
by a male sperm on the way.

00:30:59.990 --> 00:31:04.940
During this regular process, the walls of
the uterus have been building up to prepare

00:31:04.940 --> 00:31:10.549
for the nesting of the possible fertilized
egg.

00:31:10.549 --> 00:31:18.840
Then sometime after ovulation, if fertilization
has not occurred, menstruation takes place.

00:31:18.840 --> 00:31:22.620
This is a regular cleaning process.

00:31:22.620 --> 00:31:31.640
The thickened membrane lining the walls of
the uterus breaks down and is cast off.

00:31:31.640 --> 00:31:36.950
This broken tissue, together with the blood
and mucus which accompanies it, forms the

00:31:36.950 --> 00:31:43.929
substance of the menstrual discharge which
passes out through the vaginal opening.

00:31:43.929 --> 00:31:47.460
There is nothing mysterious or strange about
it.

00:31:47.460 --> 00:31:53.669
The process is as natural as the peeling and
replacement of skin cells.

00:31:53.669 --> 00:32:00.139
If the egg has been fertilized by a male reproductive
cell, or sperm, it implants itself in the

00:32:00.139 --> 00:32:06.149
lining of the wall of the uterus where it
continues to grow and menstruation usually

00:32:06.149 --> 00:32:10.679
stops.

00:32:10.679 --> 00:32:18.600
When fertilization does not occur, the processes
of menstruation, ovulation, and menstruation,

00:32:18.600 --> 00:32:25.360
take place in a regular cycle, which recurs
in most women approximately every twenty eight

00:32:25.360 --> 00:32:28.000
days.

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:32.700
However your schedule of this cycle may vary
considerably from this one.

00:32:32.700 --> 00:32:41.409
Furthermore, the cycle may be upset by changes
in bodily condition, environment, mental stress,

00:32:41.409 --> 00:33:01.129
or other causes, so that menstruation may
be hastened or delayed.

00:33:01.129 --> 00:33:06.090
If your menstrual period should be delayed
as much as a week you should see the medical

00:33:06.090 --> 00:33:10.749
officer immediately to determine the cause.

00:33:10.749 --> 00:33:16.900
Never try to bring on menstruation by any
method for they are all dangerous.

00:33:16.900 --> 00:33:21.809
Only the medical officer can safely advise
you.

00:33:21.809 --> 00:33:27.929
The most alarming things about menstruation
are the old wives tales concerning it.

00:33:27.929 --> 00:33:32.360
What we need is more frankness and less fear.

00:33:32.360 --> 00:33:39.970
I've been wanting to ask you sir, why is menstruation
often so painful?

00:33:39.970 --> 00:33:41.740
Menstruation shouldn't be painful.

00:33:41.740 --> 00:33:45.379
Pain usually indicates that something is wrong
either with the position of the reproductive

00:33:45.379 --> 00:33:47.460
organs or with their functioning.

00:33:47.460 --> 00:34:05.340
I have some charts which will explain better.

00:34:05.340 --> 00:34:11.409
And he explains that there are a number of
causes of menstrual pain or dysmenorrhea.

00:34:11.409 --> 00:34:16.940
If the uterus is not in normal position there
may be congestion during menstruation and

00:34:16.940 --> 00:34:19.460
consequent pain.

00:34:19.460 --> 00:34:29.990
There may be other anatomical reasons for
dysmenorrhea, or the cause may be functional.

00:34:29.990 --> 00:34:35.700
Here for example you can see that part of
the intestine is near the reproductive organs.

00:34:35.700 --> 00:34:41.429
Normally there is no bad effect, but constipation
may cause pressure on them and make it difficult

00:34:41.429 --> 00:34:48.990
for them to function naturally.

00:34:48.990 --> 00:34:54.380
As we have seen earlier, poor posture may
crowd the reproductive organs into unnatural

00:34:54.380 --> 00:35:06.050
positions and cause congestion with possible
resultant pain.

00:35:06.050 --> 00:35:10.600
Actually no one can diagnose the real cause
of dysmenorrhea without a thorough examination.

00:35:10.600 --> 00:35:13.369
What can be done about it?

00:35:13.369 --> 00:35:15.650
That depends on the cause.

00:35:15.650 --> 00:35:18.250
Extreme malposition may call for an operation.

00:35:18.250 --> 00:35:22.579
Naturally if the cause is constipation, the
remedy lies in its cure.

00:35:22.579 --> 00:35:26.800
Yes, but when you have cramps you want to
relieve them quickly.

00:35:26.800 --> 00:35:31.349
Well then, applications of heat, a hot water
bottle for instance, will often help to relax

00:35:31.349 --> 00:35:36.440
the muscles and relieve the pain, and drugs
such as aspirin will give temporary relief.

00:35:36.440 --> 00:35:41.200
Most of the painkilling drugs sold for this
purpose are dangerous, however, and the habit

00:35:41.200 --> 00:35:43.859
of depending on drugs is a bad one.

00:35:43.859 --> 00:35:53.760
For any severe menstrual pain you should have
a medical examination to determine the cause.

00:35:53.760 --> 00:35:58.240
Although it is advisable to keep a record
of the menstrual period, its onset should

00:35:58.240 --> 00:36:04.200
produce very little change in ones ordinary
routine.

00:36:04.200 --> 00:36:07.960
An intelligent woman will not regard herself
as ill.

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:13.800
On the contrary, though she may avoid violent
exercise, she will find ordinary accustomed

00:36:13.800 --> 00:36:21.040
forms of exercise good for her, and will take
pride in going about her duties with her accustomed

00:36:21.040 --> 00:36:25.230
enthusiasm.

00:36:25.230 --> 00:36:29.440
It is especially important to keep yourself
attractive and clean during the menstrual

00:36:29.440 --> 00:36:39.109
period since the danger of offensive body
odors is greater then, than at any other time.

00:36:39.109 --> 00:36:44.720
Regular bathing is not harmful, and is actually
essential to get rid of additional body odors

00:36:44.720 --> 00:36:47.240
which are present.

00:36:47.240 --> 00:37:00.609
It is only necessary to see that the bath
is not usually hot or unusually cold.

00:37:00.609 --> 00:37:06.900
Modern hygiene offers two good methods of
sanitary protection: the sanitary pad and

00:37:06.900 --> 00:37:09.200
the tampon.

00:37:09.200 --> 00:37:13.920
You are the best judge of their relative value
for you.

00:37:13.920 --> 00:37:19.760
If sanitary pads are used, they should be
kept clean, and should be adjusted carefully

00:37:19.760 --> 00:37:22.960
to prevent irritation.

00:37:22.960 --> 00:37:31.270
For this reason they should be fastened to
a sanitary belt, which has adjustable fasteners.

00:37:31.270 --> 00:37:37.930
Both sanitary pads and underclothing should
be changed often and as additional guard against

00:37:37.930 --> 00:37:44.559
the presence of body odor, it is wise to use
a good deodorant powder, of course selecting

00:37:44.559 --> 00:37:48.309
one which is not strong or irritating.

00:37:48.309 --> 00:37:56.609
It should also be used on the underclothing.

00:37:56.609 --> 00:38:01.640
Some women prefer the tampon to the sanitary
napkin.

00:38:01.640 --> 00:38:07.450
The tampon is inserted into the vagina to
absorb the menstrual flow.

00:38:07.450 --> 00:38:12.751
If you use the tampon be careful to see that
it is placed far enough back into the vagina

00:38:12.751 --> 00:38:20.240
to be comfortable, but not far enough to cause
pressure on the cervix.

00:38:20.240 --> 00:38:26.260
For those women in whom the vaginal opening
is small, or those who flow very heavily,

00:38:26.260 --> 00:38:30.820
the tampon is not usually satisfactory.

00:38:30.820 --> 00:38:43.650
Some women use both the sanitary pad and a
tampon during the days of heaviest flow.

00:38:43.650 --> 00:38:49.390
Many women find the vaginal douche a necessary
routine, but it is wise to have a medical

00:38:49.390 --> 00:38:56.030
examination and to get instructions from a
physician before using one for the first time.

00:38:56.030 --> 00:39:04.339
While it is not common practice to use a douche
during menstruation, it is not harmful.

00:39:04.339 --> 00:39:10.410
The douching fluid can be plain warm water,
or a solution of plain water plus one tablespoon

00:39:10.410 --> 00:39:16.859
of baking soda, or water plus one half glass
of vinegar, depending on your physician's

00:39:16.859 --> 00:39:18.579
instructions.

00:39:18.579 --> 00:39:26.270
Strong solutions should be avoided since they
injure the delicate lining of the vagina.

00:39:26.270 --> 00:39:31.950
A douche is best taken lying down in the bathtub.

00:39:31.950 --> 00:39:36.170
Since the amount of the pressure depends on
the height of the bag and little pressure

00:39:36.170 --> 00:39:41.670
is needed, place it so that the bottom of
the bag hangs about six inches above the level

00:39:41.670 --> 00:39:46.130
of the hips.

00:39:46.130 --> 00:39:54.310
The douche may also be taken sitting on the
toilet.

00:39:54.310 --> 00:39:59.760
Check the height of the bag carefully since
excessive pressure if the bag is too high

00:39:59.760 --> 00:40:06.900
may force the fluid up into the uterus.

00:40:06.900 --> 00:40:12.890
The nozzle should be gently inserted and the
labia held lightly together with the hand

00:40:12.890 --> 00:40:18.730
so that the vaginal cavity will be slightly
distended as the water enters and the fluid

00:40:18.730 --> 00:40:25.040
can flow freely out of the vagina.

00:40:25.040 --> 00:40:30.500
Since the possibility of strong pressure is
greater, many physicians feel that the bulb

00:40:30.500 --> 00:40:35.190
or hand type spray should be condemned.

00:40:35.190 --> 00:40:41.850
Others believe that it may be used but only
with the greatest care.

00:40:41.850 --> 00:40:48.390
If the hand type spray is used, the bulb should
be pressed gently with the thumb and index

00:40:48.390 --> 00:40:53.270
finger, never with the whole pressure of the
hand.

00:40:53.270 --> 00:41:02.410
Equipment for douching should be kept clean
and reserved strictly for your own use.

00:41:02.410 --> 00:41:12.849
There is great danger of infection if these
articles are exchanged.

00:41:12.849 --> 00:41:17.030
We have seen that there are glands around
the entrance to the vagina which normally

00:41:17.030 --> 00:41:19.790
secrete mucus.

00:41:19.790 --> 00:41:25.339
The amount of this secretion varies with changes
in the menstrual cycle and increases under

00:41:25.339 --> 00:41:33.119
sexual excitement, but it is usually not noticeable
in color, odor or amount.

00:41:33.119 --> 00:41:39.410
A persistent vaginal discharge which is noticeable
on your underclothing is an indication of

00:41:39.410 --> 00:41:44.250
some disorder which ought to be investigated.

00:41:44.250 --> 00:41:49.940
Only a medical examination of the individual
who has it and of the discharge itself will

00:41:49.940 --> 00:41:53.110
reveal the cause and the proper treatment.

00:41:53.110 --> 00:42:00.530
This is a type of vaginal discharge or leucorrhea,
which is not too difficult to clear up with

00:42:00.530 --> 00:42:01.530
medical treatment.

00:42:01.530 --> 00:42:07.150
Thank you sir, I was so afraid it might be
cancer.

00:42:07.150 --> 00:42:11.270
Well it's good that you came to see me about
it early.

00:42:11.270 --> 00:42:16.990
While cancer is not very common among women
of your age, it is quite dangerous when it

00:42:16.990 --> 00:42:17.990
does occur.

00:42:17.990 --> 00:42:25.299
Therefore its important to report any unusual
signs, vaginal discharge, lumps in the breast,

00:42:25.299 --> 00:42:32.670
or any abnormal growth, not because they necessarily
are cancer but to give us a chance to diagnose

00:42:32.670 --> 00:42:39.160
them, and discover cancer if it is there in
time to cure it.

00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:46.560
You know cancer is curable if the treatment
is started early enough, but you have nothing

00:42:46.560 --> 00:42:50.540
to worry about.

00:42:50.540 --> 00:42:55.610
None of you need worry about your health if
you rely on your medical officers and remember

00:42:55.610 --> 00:42:59.810
the rules of personal hygiene.

00:42:59.810 --> 00:43:04.819
One important purpose of your basic training
is to make the fundamentals of healthful living

00:43:04.819 --> 00:43:10.620
so automatic that no physical disability will
appear to prevent you from carrying out the

00:43:10.620 --> 00:43:13.900
important jobs you are here to do.

00:43:13.900 --> 00:43:20.140
Perhaps you will be sent to a naval air station
like this where thousand of posts of duty

00:43:20.140 --> 00:43:25.349
await women who are dependable and well trained.

00:43:25.349 --> 00:43:31.820
Perhaps you'll be stationed at a naval base,
but where ever you are, you will have a woman

00:43:31.820 --> 00:43:33.540
sized job.

00:43:33.540 --> 00:43:38.610
Keeping yourself in the best possible physical
condition for it need not be difficult if

00:43:38.610 --> 00:43:46.160
you consider that the basis of all good health
is a balanced routine of proper diet, sleep,

00:43:46.160 --> 00:43:50.049
exercise, and relaxation,

00:43:50.049 --> 00:43:57.980
that high standards for personal cleanliness
will prevent most disorders, and that carelessness,

00:43:57.980 --> 00:44:06.880
ignorance, superstition, and fear are your
worst enemies.

00:44:06.880 --> 00:44:13.319
If you remember these things, you will help
to attain the goal of the whole women's reserve

00:44:13.319 --> 00:44:16.150
and keep every woman at her post everyday.

00:44:16.150 --> 00:44:17.180
[The End.

00:44:17.180 --> 00:44:20.780
MN-1712-A. United States of America Navy Department.

00:44:20.780 --> 00:44:22.319
Bureau of Aeronautics.

00:44:22.319 --> 00:44:22.829
MCMXLIII.]

